													"disabled": true
												}
											]
										},
										"description": "### Endpoint Overview\n\nThis endpoint retrieves the detailed presence information for a specific user based on the provided unique identifier.\n\n### Request\n\n- **Method:** GET\n    \n- **URL:** `{{LOCAL_HOST}}/kader/presensi-ibk/detail/{id}`\n    \n- **Path Parameter:**\n    \n    - `id` (string): The unique identifier for the presence record you wish to retrieve.\n        \n\n### Response\n\n- **Status Code:** 200 OK\n    \n- **Content-Type:** application/json\n    \n- {\"id\": \"\",\"user_ibk_id\": \"\",\"jadwal_id\": \"\",\"status_presensi\": \"\",\"created_at\": \"\",\"updated_at\": null,\"deleted_at\": null,\"ibk\": { \"id\": \"\", \"nama\": \"\", \"nik\": 0, \"jenis_kelamin\": \"\", \"alamat\": \"\"},\"jadwal_posyandu\": { \"id\": \"\", \"nama_kegiatan\": \"\", \"tanggal\": \"\", \"waktu_mulai\": \"\", \"waktu_selesai\": \"\", \"lokasi\": \"\"}}\n    \n\n### Response Fields\n\n- `id`: The unique identifier for the presence record.\n    \n- `user_ibk_id`: The identifier for the user associated with the presence.\n    \n- `jadwal_id`: The identifier for the schedule linked to the presence.\n    \n- `status_presensi`: The status of the presence (e.g., present, absent).\n    \n- `created_at`: Timestamp of when the presence record was created.\n    \n- `updated_at`: Timestamp of the last update to the presence record.\n    \n- `deleted_at`: Timestamp indicating if the record has been deleted.\n    \n- `ibk`: An object containing details about the user:\n    \n    - `id`: The unique identifier for the user.\n        \n    - `nama`: The name of the user.\n        \n    - `nik`: The identification number of the user.\n        \n    - `jenis_kelamin`: The gender of the user.\n        \n    - `alamat`: The address of the user.\n        \n- `jadwal_posyandu`: An object containing details about the schedule:\n    \n    - `id`: The unique identifier for the schedule.\n        \n    - `nama_kegiatan`: The name of the activity.\n        \n    - `tanggal`: The date of the scheduled activity.\n        \n    - `waktu_mulai`: The start time of the activity.\n        \n    - `waktu_selesai`: The end time of the activity.\n        \n    - `lokasi`: The location of the activity.\n        \n\nThis endpoint is useful for retrieving detailed information regarding a specific presence record, including user and schedule details."
									},
									"response": []
								},
